el their command burn within me. This world is broken, and I am its reckoning. For I am VOIN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/e881e29943b021be7f65db9c393e61e0.poster.avif?t=1752529717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/e881e29943b021be7f65db9c393e61e0.webm?t=1752529717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/e881e29943b021be7f65db9c393e61e0.mp4?t=1752529717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/603ed94a763bf934c89d00afd1505fea.poster.avif?t=1752529717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/603ed94a763bf934c89d00afd1505fea.webm?t=1752529717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/603ed94a763bf934c89d00afd1505fea.mp4?t=1752529717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike I make is a hymn to destruction. My movements are a sacred dance within the heart of chaos.\u00a0My blade sings as I sever through their ranks, executing perfect strikes, untouchable. I walk this path with purpose\u2014will I remain unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/454d196c5cc669dfb70c86daf85f2de4.poster.avif?t=1752529717\" ><